      * C805996          RUTINA ENCARGADA DE LLAMAR PARAMETRIA DE PROD-*
      * JIRA:            UCTOS, LA CUAL SE TOMA LA TABLA UGDTT37, ESTO *
      * COLWSCRM-2351    SE REALIZA PARA DESPLEGAR PRODUCTOS EN MODULO *
      *                  CONTACTABILIDAD.                              *
      * ------- -------- --------------------------------------------- *00001000
      * C805996 20230725 SE CREA OPCION '02' PARA DESPLEGAR PRODUCTOS  *
      * JIRA:            LO CUALES SE TOMARAN DE LA SECCION 0096 Y DES *
      * COLWSCRM-4265    PLEGGARA INFORMACION NECESARIA PARA FILTROS DE*
      * SIRI04           PRODUCTOS EN AUG.                             *
      *                  - SE COLOCA SET SI-ERROR, PARA CONTROLAR ERRO-*
      *                  RES DE LA RUTINA.                             *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       01 WS-VARIABLES-TRABAJO.
          05 WS-I                          PIC 9(03).
          05 WS-MIN-AUX                    PIC 9(02).
          05 WS-ELEMENTO.
             07 WS-TIP-CLI                 PIC X(02).
             07 WS-TIP-PRO                 PIC X(03).
             07 WS-COD-PRO                 PIC X(03).
             07 WS-RES-CLA                 PIC X(14).
          05 WS-RESTO                      PIC X(22).
          05 WS-MIN-CED                    PIC X(22).
          05 WS-CEDULA                     PIC X(15).
          05 WS-TIPOCLIEN                  PIC X(17).
          05 WS-OFICINA                    PIC X(04).
          05 WS-PRODUCT1                   PIC X(105).
          05 WS-PRODUCT2                   PIC X(86).
          05 WS-SUBPROD                    PIC X(05).
          05 WS-TIMESTAMP-VEH              PIC X(26).
          05 WS-CONTADOR                   PIC S9(02) COMP-3.
          05 WS-SECCION                    PIC X(04).
       01 WS-ELEMT.
          05 WS-TIPOPER                    PIC X(02).
          05 WS-TIPPROD                    PIC X(03).
          05 WS-PRODUCTO                   PIC X(03).
          05 WS-SUBPRODUC                  PIC X(04).
      ******************************************************************
      *                          RETORNOS DB2                          *
      ******************************************************************
       01 WS-MASCARAS.
          05 WS-MAS-DEPTO                  PIC ZZZZ9.
          05 WS-MAS-CIUDAD                 PIC ZZZZZ9.
          05 WS-MAS-OFICINA                PIC 9999.
          05 WS-MAS-SQLCODE                PIC +999.
          05 WS-MAS-MIN                    PIC 99.

      ******************************************************************
      *                          RETORNOS DB2                          *
      ******************************************************************
       01 DB2-RETURN                       PIC S9(9) COMP.
          88 DB2-OK                                  VALUE +0.
          88 DB2-NOTFND                              VALUE +100.
          88 DB2-DUPREC                              VALUE -803.
          88 DB2-DUPSEL                              VALUE -811.
          88 DB2-305                                 VALUE -305.

       01 WS-MASCARA                       PIC +ZZZZZZ999.

      ******************************************************************
      *                   A R E A  D E  S W I T C H                    *
      ******************************************************************
       01 WS-SWITCH.
          05 SW-ENCONTRO                   PIC X(01) VALUE 'N'.
             88 SW-ENCONTRO-SI                       VALUE 'S'.
             88 SW-ENCONTRO-NO                       VALUE 'N'.

          05 SW-CURSOR-FIN                 PIC X(01) VALUE 'N'.
             88 SW-CURSOR-FIN-SI                     VALUE 'S'.
             88 SW-CURSOR-FIN-NO                     VALUE 'N'.


          05 SW-ERROR-STATUS               PIC 9(01) VALUE 0.
             88 NO-ERROR                   VALUE ZEROS.
             88 SI-ERROR                   VALUE 1.

      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SQLCA   END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE UGGTT37 END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE UGTCT37 END-EXEC.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
          COPY QGECABC.
          COPY UGWCT370.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *                  C U R S O R E S  D B 2                        *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      * CURSOR PARA TRAER INFORMACION DE PRODUCTOS POR PARAMETRIA
           EXEC SQL
                DECLARE CURSOR-PARM CURSOR
                    FOR SELECT
                        ELEMENTO
                       ,RESTO
                FROM  UGDTT37
                WHERE SECCION  = :T37-SECCION
                AND   ELEMENTO LIKE :T37-ELEMENTO
           END-EXEC.
      *SIRI04-I
      * CURSOR PARA TRAER INFORMACION DE PRODUCTOS 0096 PARAMETRIA
           EXEC SQL
                DECLARE CURSOR-PARA CURSOR
                    FOR SELECT
                        ELEMENTO
                       ,RESTO
                FROM  UGDTT37
                WHERE SECCION  = :T37-SECCION
           END-EXEC.
      *SIRI04-F
      *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01 DFHCOMMAREA.
          COPY UGWCTGCP.
      ******************************************************************
      *                  PROCEDURE DIVISION                            *
      ******************************************************************
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           PERFORM 100-INICIO
           PERFORM 200-PROCESO
           PERFORM 300-FINAL.

      ******************************************************************
      * SE VALIDA LOS CAMPOS INICIALES                                 *
      ******************************************************************
       100-INICIO.
           EXEC CICS
              IGNORE CONDITION ERROR
           END-EXEC
           INITIALIZE UGCP-SALIDA
           IF UGCP-OPCION EQUAL SPACES OR LOW-VALUES
              MOVE '20'                     TO UGCP-COD-RETORNO
              MOVE '0000020'                TO UGCP-VAR1-MENSAJE
              MOVE 'ERROR OPC NO INFORMADA' TO UGCP-VAR2-MENSAJE
      *SIRI04-I
              SET SI-ERROR                  TO TRUE
      *SIRI04-F
              PERFORM 300-FINAL
           ELSE
              IF UGCP-SECCION EQUAL SPACES OR LOW-VALUES
                 MOVE '30'                  TO UGCP-COD-RETORNO
                 MOVE '0000030'             TO UGCP-VAR1-MENSAJE
                 MOVE 'ERROR SECCION NO INFORMADA'
                                            TO UGCP-VAR2-MENSAJE
      *SIRI04-I
                 SET SI-ERROR                  TO TRUE
      *SIRI04-F
                 PERFORM 300-FINAL
              END-IF
           END-IF.

      ******************************************************************
      * SE REALIZA LA OPCION ENVIADA                                   *
      ******************************************************************
       200-PROCESO.
             MOVE '00'                      TO UGCP-COD-RETORNO
             EVALUATE UGCP-OPCION
                 WHEN '01'
                      PERFORM 230-CURSOR-PARA-TIPOCLIENTE
      *SIRI04-I
                 WHEN '02'
                      PERFORM 236-CURSOR-PARA-PARAMETRIA
      *SIRI04-F
                 WHEN OTHER
                      MOVE '50'               TO UGCP-COD-RETORNO
                      MOVE '0000050'          TO UGCP-VAR1-MENSAJE
                      MOVE 'ERROR OPC MAL INFORMADA'
                                              TO UGCP-VAR2-MENSAJE
      *SIRI04-I
                      SET SI-ERROR            TO TRUE
      *SIRI04-F
                      PERFORM 300-FINAL
                 END-EVALUATE.

      ******************************************************************
      * SE CONSULTA UN REGISTRO EN LA TABLA UGDTT37                    *
      ******************************************************************

      ******************************************************************
      * SE ACTUALIZA EL ULTIMO REGISTRO DE LA CUIDAD Y DEPTO POR OFICINA
      ******************************************************************
       230-CURSOR-PARA-TIPOCLIENTE.
           PERFORM 231-ABRIR-CURSOR
           PERFORM 232-FETCH-CURSOR UNTIL SW-CURSOR-FIN-SI
           PERFORM 234-CLOSE-CURSOR.

      ******************************************************************
      * SE ABRE CURSOR PARA TRAER PRODUCTOS DE TABLA UGDTT37           *
      ******************************************************************
       231-ABRIR-CURSOR.
           MOVE UGCP-SECCION                TO T37-SECCION
           MOVE UGCP-TIPODECLI              TO WS-TIP-CLI
           MOVE UGCP-TIPODEPRO              TO WS-TIP-PRO
           MOVE UGCP-PRODUCTO               TO WS-COD-PRO
           IF WS-COD-PRO = SPACES
              MOVE ALL '%'                  TO WS-COD-PRO
           END-IF
           MOVE ALL '%'                     TO WS-RES-CLA

           MOVE WS-ELEMENTO                 TO T37-ELEMENTO
           EXEC SQL OPEN CURSOR-PARM END-EXEC

           MOVE SQLCODE                     TO DB2-RETURN


           EVALUATE SQLCODE                                             00530000
               WHEN ZEROES
                    MOVE '00'               TO UGCP-COD-RETORNO
                    ADD 1                   TO WS-I
               WHEN OTHER                                               00530100
                    MOVE '90'               TO UGCP-COD-RETORNO
                    MOVE '0000090'          TO UGCP-VAR1-MENSAJE
                    MOVE 'ERROR, OPEN CURSOR-PARM'
                                            TO UGCP-VAR2-MENSAJE
      *SIRI04-I
                    MOVE SQLCODE            TO UGCP-SQLCODE
                    SET SI-ERROR            TO TRUE
      *SIRI04-F
                    PERFORM 300-FINAL
           END-EVALUATE.

      ******************************************************************
      * SE ACTUALIZA EL CONTADOR PARA ESA CEDULA (SECUENCIA)           *
      ******************************************************************
       232-FETCH-CURSOR.
           EXEC SQL
                FETCH CURSOR-PARM INTO
                      :T37-ELEMENTO
                     ,:T37-RESTO
           END-EXEC

           MOVE SQLCODE                     TO DB2-RETURN


           EVALUATE SQLCODE
               WHEN ZEROS
                    PERFORM 2321-CARGA-PAR
                    SET SW-CURSOR-FIN-NO    TO TRUE
               WHEN +100
                    SET SW-CURSOR-FIN-SI    TO TRUE
                    MOVE ZEROES             TO WS-I
                    ADD 1                   TO WS-I
               WHEN -305
                    MOVE '80'               TO UGCP-COD-RETORNO
                    MOVE '0000000'          TO UGCP-VAR1-MENSAJE
                    MOVE 'NO INFO UGDTT37 OK'
                                            TO UGCP-VAR2-MENSAJE
      *SIRI04-I
                    SET SI-ERROR                  TO TRUE
      *SIRI04-F
                    PERFORM 300-FINAL
               WHEN OTHER                                               00530100
                    MOVE '90'               TO UGCP-COD-RETORNO
                    MOVE '0000090'          TO UGCP-VAR1-MENSAJE
                    MOVE 'ERROR, FECTH CURSOR-PARM'
                                            TO UGCP-VAR2-MENSAJE
      *SIRI04-I
                    SET SI-ERROR                  TO TRUE
      *SIRI04-F
                    PERFORM 300-FINAL
           END-EVALUATE.
      *SIRI04-I
      ******************************************************************
      * SE ACTUALIZA EL ULTIMO REGISTRO DE LA CUIDAD Y DEPTO POR OFICINA
      ******************************************************************
       236-CURSOR-PARA-PARAMETRIA.
           PERFORM 237-ABRIR-CURSOR
           PERFORM 238-FETCH-CURSOR UNTIL SW-CURSOR-FIN-SI
           PERFORM 239-CLOSE-CURSOR.

      ******************************************************************
      * SE ABRE CURSOR PARA TRAER PRODUCTOS DE TABLA UGDTT37           *
      ******************************************************************
       237-ABRIR-CURSOR.
           MOVE UGCP-SECCION                TO T37-SECCION

           EXEC SQL OPEN CURSOR-PARA END-EXEC

           MOVE SQLCODE                     TO DB2-RETURN


           EVALUATE SQLCODE                                             00530000
               WHEN ZEROES
                    MOVE '00'               TO UGCP-COD-RETORNO
                    ADD 1                   TO WS-I
               WHEN OTHER                                               00530100
                    MOVE '90'               TO UGCP-COD-RETORNO
                    MOVE '0000090'          TO UGCP-VAR1-MENSAJE
                    MOVE 'ERROR, OPEN CURSOR-PARA'
                                            TO UGCP-VAR2-MENSAJE
      *SIRI04-I
                    MOVE SQLCODE            TO UGCP-SQLCODE
                    SET SI-ERROR            TO TRUE
      *SIRI04-F
                    PERFORM 300-FINAL
           END-EVALUATE.

      ******************************************************************
       238-FETCH-CURSOR.
           EXEC SQL
                FETCH CURSOR-PARA INTO
                      :T37-ELEMENTO
                     ,:T37-RESTO
           END-EXEC

           MOVE SQLCODE                     TO DB2-RETURN


           EVALUATE SQLCODE
               WHEN ZEROS
                    PERFORM 2321-CARGA-PAR
                    SET SW-CURSOR-FIN-NO    TO TRUE
               WHEN +100
                    SET SW-CURSOR-FIN-SI    TO TRUE
                    MOVE ZEROES             TO WS-I
                    ADD 1                   TO WS-I
               WHEN -305
                    MOVE '80'               TO UGCP-COD-RETORNO
                    MOVE '0000000'          TO UGCP-VAR1-MENSAJE
                    MOVE 'NO INFORMA UGDTT37 OK'
                                            TO UGCP-VAR2-MENSAJE
      *SIRI04-I
                    SET SI-ERROR            TO TRUE
      *SIRI04-F
                    PERFORM 300-FINAL
               WHEN OTHER                                               00530100
                    MOVE '90'               TO UGCP-COD-RETORNO
                    MOVE '0000090'          TO UGCP-VAR1-MENSAJE
                    MOVE 'ERROR, FECTH CURSOR-PARA'
                                            TO UGCP-VAR2-MENSAJE
      *SIRI04-I
                    SET SI-ERROR            TO TRUE
      *SIRI04-F
                    PERFORM 300-FINAL
           END-EVALUATE.
      *SIRI04-F
      ******************************************************************
      * SE CARGA TABLA DINAMICA CON TODOS LAS RESULTADOS DEL FECTH 232 *
      ******************************************************************
       2321-CARGA-PAR.
           MOVE T37-ELEMENTO                TO UGCP-ELEMENTO(WS-I)
           MOVE T37-RESTO(01:50)            TO UGCP-RESTO(WS-I)
           ADD 1                            TO WS-I
                                               UGCP-NUM-REG.

      ******************************************************************
      * SE ACTUALIZA EL CONTADOR PARA ESA CEDULA (SECUENCIA)           *
      ******************************************************************
       234-CLOSE-CURSOR.
           EXEC SQL CLOSE CURSOR-PARM END-EXEC

           MOVE SQLCODE                     TO DB2-RETURN

           EVALUATE SQLCODE                                             00530000
               WHEN ZEROS
                    CONTINUE
               WHEN OTHER                                               00530100
                    MOVE '90'               TO UGCP-COD-RETORNO
                    MOVE '0000090'          TO UGCP-VAR1-MENSAJE
                    MOVE 'ERROR, CLOSE CURSOR-PARM'
                                            TO UGCP-VAR2-MENSAJE
      *SIRI04-I
                    SET SI-ERROR            TO TRUE
      *SIRI04-F
                    PERFORM 300-FINAL
           END-EVALUATE.
      *SIRI04-I
      ******************************************************************
       239-CLOSE-CURSOR.
           EXEC SQL CLOSE CURSOR-PARA END-EXEC

           MOVE SQLCODE                     TO DB2-RETURN

           EVALUATE SQLCODE                                             00530000
               WHEN ZEROS
                    CONTINUE
               WHEN OTHER                                               00530100
                    MOVE '90'               TO UGCP-COD-RETORNO
                    MOVE '0000090'          TO UGCP-VAR1-MENSAJE
                    MOVE 'ERROR, CLOSE CURSOR-PARA'
                                            TO UGCP-VAR2-MENSAJE
      *SIRI04-I
                    SET SI-ERROR            TO TRUE
      *SIRI04-F
                    PERFORM 300-FINAL
           END-EVALUATE.
      *SIRI04-F
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *                      3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA                       *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       300-FINAL.

           IF NO-ERROR
              MOVE '00'                 TO UGCP-COD-RETORNO
              MOVE SPACES               TO UGCP-VAR1-MENSAJE
              MOVE ZEROS                TO UGCP-SQLCODE
           END-IF

           EXEC CICS
              RETURN
           END-EXEC.
